INSERT INTO "cars" ("id","year","make","model","supername","brand","series","country","category","description","broken_image","Cover","name_format") VALUES(3508,'1987','Alfa Romeo','75 1.8i Turbo Evoluzione Rally','','Laudoracing','','[]','["Retro Rally"]','This car was inspired by the Alfa Romeo 75 Turbo, with several substantial mechanical modifications. These modifications were concerned mainly with the turbocompressor and cooling system, which increased the power and torque of the vehicle substantially. The professional rally models underwent further modifications to their brakes and suspension and enjoyed success in what was nevertheless a short career. The Evoluzione model is famed especially for its elegant interior and the number of cars produced.',0,0,0);
INSERT INTO "cars" ("id","year","make","model","supername","brand","series","country","category","description","broken_image","Cover","name_format") VALUES(3509,'1989','Alfa Romeo','SZ (Es 30)','','Laudoracing','','[]','["Retro Sports Cars"]','A little more than a thousand of these cars were produced. The Alfa SZ is unique because it combines sports features with understated styling, keeping the distinctive features of its prototype. The mechanics were inspired by the Alfa 75 in terms of engine and the braking system, whilst the body (and the materials used in its manufacture) are much more recent. The car has a carbon fibre and fibreglass body, quality aluminium roof and modified sus-pension to support the increased power. It''s worth mentioning the hydraulics system, too, which allows the driver to alter the road clearance of the car, and the spider version that was renamed as the RZ.',0,0,0);
